# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CITIZEN DOCUMENTS MUST NEVER ENTER THIS TREE.
#
# This repo sits inside OneDrive, which syncs to Microsoft's cloud. A real caste
# certificate, income certificate or land record dropped in here would silently be
# uploaded offsite and would be very hard to recall. These patterns are a safety net,
# not permission — see the warning in RUNNING.md.
#
# The PWA's own icons are the deliberate exception below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.bmp
*.heic
*.pdf
*.scan

!web/public/icon-*.png

# NSFDC's published Channel Partner lists. Government documents naming banks and state
# corporations, downloaded from nsfdc.nic.in — the opposite of a citizen document, and
# they carry nobody's personal data. They are here because corpus/partners/*.yaml is
# extracted from them, and NSFDC re-uploads rather than replaces, so the URLs those
# files cite can stop resolving. Checksums are in the MANIFEST.yaml beside them.
#
# This exception is deliberately one directory and one extension wide. Do not broaden
# it, and never put a scan of anyone's certificate here.
!corpus/partners/sources/*.pdf
